 "intro": "Report an officeholder change\nJanani Ramachandran is a member of the Oakland City Council in California, representing District 4. She assumed office on January 2, 2023. Her current term ends on January 4, 2027.\nRamachandran is running for re-election to the Oakland City Council to represent District 4 in California. She is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026.",
